ser":{"login":"romgerman","id":1517367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTczNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1517367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman","html_url":"https://github.com/romgerman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-07T17:17:18Z","updated_at":"2026-08-07T17:19:43Z","body":"This is very annoying when dealing with modular models (hundreds of them in a file) that go through a custom import script that saves every mesh into its own scene. Every time it just changes the `unique_id` and that's it. So I get hundreds of files changed without any actual changes in my git repo every time I add or edit something in the source glb file. This wasn't present in 4.5. I'm on 4.6.3.\n\n```patch\ndiff --git a/models/Scenes/SM_Ceiling_2x1_A.tscn b/models/Scenes/SM_Ceiling_2x1_A.tscn\nindex 7a05a60..1d16a3e 100644\n--- a/models/Scenes/SM_Ceiling_2x1_A.tscn\n+++ b/models/Scenes/SM_Ceiling_2x1_A.tscn\n@@ -5,11 +5,11 @@\n [sub_resource type=\"ConvexPolygonShape3D\" id=\"ConvexPolygonShape3D_8beki\"]\n points = PackedVector3Array(-1, -0.060000397, -1.6391278e-08, -1, -0.010000072, -1.6391278e-08, 1, -0.060000397, -1.6391278e-08, -1, -0.060000397, 1, -1, -0.010004967, 1, 1, -0.010000072, -1.6391278e-08, 1, -0.060000397, 1, 1, -0.010004967, 1)\n \n-[node name=\"SM_Ceiling_2x1_A\" type=\"MeshInstance3D\" unique_id=1192110502]\n+[node name=\"SM_Ceiling_2x1_A\" type=\"MeshInstance3D\" unique_id=656838584]\n mesh = ExtResource(\"1_8beki\")\n skeleton = NodePath(\"\")\n \n-[node name=\"SM_Ceiling_2x1_A \" type=\"StaticBody3D\" parent=\".\" unique_id=1091227696]\n+[node name=\"SM_Ceiling_2x1_A \" type=\"StaticBody3D\" parent=\".\" unique_id=648672769]\n \n-[node name=\"CollisionShape3D\" type=\"CollisionShape3D\" parent=\"SM_Ceiling_2x1_A \" unique_id=1580392317]\n+[node name=\"CollisionShape3D\" type=\"CollisionShape3D\" parent=\"SM_Ceiling_2x1_A \" unique_id=654658599]\n shape = SubResource(\"ConvexPolygonShape3D_8beki\")\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5220014400/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]